          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ruthu kupata mndwawomi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konyuma Naomi ukamzera Ruthu, “Ni nicha nikulolie muzi nga mao eri kuwone kaia nicha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nechi Boazi, umundu wai wake moresindanyagha, ni mundu odu wa ifwa. Ola linu uchakaia ukiela shairi nakio aja lwala lochania viro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwu kukuoghoshe, kukushinge mavuda, na kurwa nguwo rako riboie, nao kusee cha lwalenyi lochanira viro; ela kusekumanyishe kwake, hata umerie kuja na kunywa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela ukameria kulala, kuzighane andu walalia, hata ukameria kuwadwa ni dilo, kwende kufunukuo nguwo wakufinikira cha maghunyi, nao kulale maghunyi kwake. Uchakughoria ilagho jebonya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruthu ukamtumbulia, “Nichabonya kula ilagho kwanizera nibonye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Ruthu ukasea cha lwalenyi lochania viro ukabonya sa iji koni uzereloghe ni mkekwake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata iji Boazi wameria kuja na kunywa, na ngolo yake kusikira nicha, ukaghenda konenyi andu mabunda gha shairi gheretumbanyiroghe, ukalala aho. Niko Ruthu ukacha mboa-mboa kwa kiviso ukamfunukua Boazi nguwo wakufinikira cha maghunyi; ukalala aho maghunyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kio ghadi, Boazi ukaturukia, ukaghaluka luwaru, ukashinika kuwona muka walala maghunyi kwake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukakotia “Nani oho?” Ukatumbulia, “Ni ini Ruthu; nakulomba kunifinikire nguwo, kwa kukaia ni oho mundu odu wa ifwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao ukamzera, “BWANA ndekurasimie mwai wapo, kwa kukaia wucha kwaghuwonyera idana, ghwachumba ghuja ghwa imbiri kughubonyere kwa mkekwako; angu kusewinughie wandu wa irika, wikaiagha wiko na mali angu wisene mali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Idana mwai wapo kuseobuo, nichakubonyera kula ilagho kwajilomba, kwa kukaia kula mundu uko andenyi ya ughu muzi waichi angu ko muka kuboie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Loli ini ne mundu wa kichuku chako, ela koko mundu uko wa kichuku cha kaavui kunichumba ini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "RUT.2.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rut. 2.20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wesera ndoe iele; kesho dichakotia ngera ucharumiria kukuwusa; ukarumiria ni nicha, ela iji walegha kukuwusa, naghema kwa Mlungu uko moyo, ini nichakuwusa. Oho lala hata ndoe iele.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko ukalala aho kwake hata nakesho, ela ukawuka kokio, imbiri ya ngelo mndungi usedimagha kummanya mmbao; na Boazi ukamzera, “Lindia mndungi usemanye wei muka wachee lwala lochania viro.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boazi ukamzera, “Rua shuka yako kuiale aha.” Nao ukaiala, na Boazi ukamdungia kilo mirongo iwi ra shairi, ukamdukishira; nao ukaghenda cha mzinyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata iji wavika mzinyi, mkekwake ukamkotia, “Malagho ghakaie wada mwai wapo?” Ukamghoria ghose ghibonyero ni uja mundu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukachuria kumzera, “Na iri kilo mirongo iwi nuo moni wanineka, ukanizera niseche kwako mikonu miduu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao ukamzera, “Wesera mao hata kwamanya seji iri maza righendagha; kwa kukaia umundu ndechaahora hata wameria kukatisha maza rose idime.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
